# Pairs with AtomicOnOwner. The saga checkpoints k1 as dispatched when it
# starts, before dispatching it, so it decides with only k2 prepared and the
# batch commits torn.
MODULE: AtomicOnOwnerRetainedStartCheckpointsEntry
TARGET: AtomicOnOwner
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the saga records an entry as dispatched before dispatching it, so the batch commits torn
PERTURBS: SagaStart

--- FIND
    /\ bound' = alias
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, pend, term, sp, spCopy, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, prepped, told, dec, masked, forgotten, late, wDone, reacted, ackOn, lk, lt>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ bound' = alias
\* MUTATION: k1 is checkpointed as dispatched without being dispatched.
    /\ prepped' = {k1}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, pend, term, sp, spCopy, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, told, dec, masked, forgotten, late, wDone, reacted, ackOn, lk, lt>>
--- END
